sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as User / Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway (8000)
    participant Ord as Order Service (8003)
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ (shopops.events)
    participant Inv as Inventory Service (8004)
    participant Pay as Payment Service (8005)
    participant Notif as Notification Service (8006)
    participant Redis as Redis (Customer Inbox)

    Customer->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders (Items, CustomerId)
    GW->>Ord: Proxy POST /api/v1/orders (x-correlation-id)
    Ord->>Ord: Persist Order (Status: PENDING)
    Ord-->>GW: 201 Created (OrderId, Status: PENDING)
    GW-->>Customer: 201 Created

    Ord->>RMQ: Publish order.created
    par Async Saga Execution
        RMQ->>Inv: Deliver order.created
        Inv->>Inv: Reserve Stock (decrement available, increment reserved)
        Inv->>RMQ: Publish inventory.reserved
    and Notification
        RMQ->>Notif: Deliver order.created
        Notif->>Redis: LPUSH inbox:customerId ("Order Received")
    end

    RMQ->>Pay: Deliver inventory.reserved
    Pay->>Pay: Authorize Transaction (Generate tx-ref)
    Pay->>RMQ: Publish payment.completed

    par Order Completion
        RMQ->>Ord: Deliver payment.completed
        Ord->>Ord: Update Order (Status: COMPLETED)
    and Inventory Finalization
        RMQ->>Inv: Deliver payment.completed
        Inv->>Inv: Commit Stock (decrement reserved)
    and Customer Notification
        RMQ->>Notif: Deliver payment.completed
        Notif->>Redis: LPUSH inbox:customerId ("Payment Succeeded, Order Confirmed")
    end

    Customer->>GW: GET /api/v1/orders/:orderId
    GW->>Ord: Proxy GET
    Ord-->>Customer: 200 OK (Status: COMPLETED)
